# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# API requests are handled by functions/api/[[path]].js (Cloudflare Pages
# Function proxy), so /api/* never reaches this file.
#
# No SPA catch-all is needed because the frontend uses hash-based routing
# (#dashboard, #customers, etc.) — the URL path before the hash stays as
# /app.html, and the index.html meta-refresh already guides users there.
